# Everything on the Mac: `brew bundle` installs it, scripts/packages-macos.sh runs it.
# `mas` apps need an App Store login; without one they are skipped with a warning.
# tofu, terragrunt and tflint are pinned release binaries from scripts/tools.sh, not brew.
# Snapshot of what is installed: `brew leaves --installed-on-request`, `brew list --cask`, `mas list`.

